message: "If you use this software, please cite the repository and the exact commit."
title: "Time-Series Forecasting: Research & Build"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tran
    given-names: Tuan
repository-code: "https://github.com/tuanthescientist/Timeseries_Forecasting_Research_and_Build"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
abstract: >-
  A reproducible protocol for evaluating financial return forecasts against persistence
  under explicit information constraints, with sequentially calibrated prediction
  intervals (split and adaptive conformal). Results on VN30 and BID are reported,
  including negative findings.
keywords:
  - time-series forecasting
  - rolling-origin evaluation
  - conformal prediction
  - uncertainty calibration
  - financial time series
